<title>NEW ZEALAND: Port of Tauranga appoints Mayson CEO.</title>
<headline>Port of Tauranga appoints Mayson CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Port of Tauranga Ltd on Thursday announced the appointment of Jon Mayson as chief executive.</p>
<p>Mayson has been acting chief executive since January after John Halling's resignation, and was previously Operations Manager at the port.</p>
<p>His appointment followed an international executive search.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
